@base = http://localhost:5256

###search history mutation
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/transactions?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### berdasarkan referenceNo
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/transactions?referenceNo=RF001
Accept: application/json


### type dan status
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/transactions?type=TRANSFER&status=SUCCESS
Accept: application/json

### tanggal dan sorting
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/transactions?fromDate=2026-11-01&toDate=2026-11-17&sort=date_desc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json


### mutasi wallet
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/mutations?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### mutasi IN
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/mutations?direction=IN
Accept: application/json

### mutasi OUT
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/mutations?direction=OUT
Accept: application/json

### mutasi filter pakai date
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1/history/mutations?referenceNo=RF001&fromDate=2026-11-01&toDate=2026-11-17&sort=date_desc
Accept: application/json